{
  "id": 8867139322055,
  "title": "Christian Bedding Set – Inspirational Bible Verse Comforte - Design 04",
  "handle": "christian-bedding-set-inspirational-bible-verse-comforte-design-04",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this beautifully designed Christian bedding set, featuring inspiring Bible verses and accents, perfect as a thoughtful gift for the women in your life. This set offers a constant reminder of faith and love, ideal for birthdays or special occasions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational Christian bedding set perfect for women, including Mom, Daughter, and Sister, for birthdays or special occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type Options:</strong> Available as a duvet cover (no filling insert, two sheets sewn together) for a lightweight, customizable option or a comforter for all-in-one warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package includes 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fill Material:</strong> Comforters include whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier; a mesh laundry bag is recommended for washing.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Christian Knight Templar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
